<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This is just a little AFK script to help keep from getting bootted for inactivity. You will spin in cirlces for now. I will change later however to add jumping and crouching. I would really like to add an emote in there well see if i can. Anyway pretty simple just bind to an unused key. Tap that button before you get off, then tap it again when you ccome back. Easy Peasy Lemon Squeezy.</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>RightDown 1
Delay 64 ms
MoveR 6 0
Delay 64 64 ms
MoveR 12 0
Delay 64 64 ms
MoveR 18 0
Delay 64 64 ms
MoveR 24 0
Delay 64 64 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 64 64 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 64 64 ms
MoveR 30 0
Delay 64 64 ms
MoveR 36 0
Delay 64 64 ms
MoveR 42 0
Delay 64 64 ms
MoveR 48 0
Delay 64 64 ms
MoveR 54 0
Delay 64 64 ms
KeyDown 224 1
Delay 64 64 ms
KeyUp 224 1
Delay 64 64 ms
MoveR 60 0
Delay 64 64 ms
MoveR 66 0
Delay 64 64 ms
MoveR 72 0
Delay 64 64 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 64 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rust</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>